"⟪k:0⟫And at the same time, the White-Haired Girl lovingly ran her fingertips across his skin."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その間にも、⟪k:1⟫娘の細い指先は彼の肌に伸び、⟪k:2⟫愛おしそうに撫で続けるのです。"

